{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37248","headline":"癸卯岁毘陵登高会中贻同志 · 章谒","name":"癸卯岁毘陵登高会中贻同志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"流落常嗟胜会稀，故人相遇菊花时。\n凤笙龙笛数巡酒，红树碧山无限诗。\n尘土十分归举子，乾坤大半属偷儿。\n长杨羽猎须留本，开济重爲阙下期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}